<p. 1a> śrīgaṇeśāya namaḥ || 

karppūragauraśuddhāṅgamaṅgasaṃlagne maṅgalaṃ | 
vilasanmauli kallolagaṅgāṃ mṛtyuñjayaṃ bhaje ||

[atha śrīgaṇapatyādi caturāyatanāṅgasahita śrīmṛtyuñjayanityārccanapaddhati 
likhyate] ||

tatrādau pūjakaḥ kṛtanityakriyaḥ sūryāyārghaṃ dadyāt || oṃ haṃ saḥ 
śrīsūryyabhaṭṭārakāya pañcāyatanapūjāṃ kartumeṣo'rgho namaḥ || 

mūlena bhūtaśuddhi prāṇāyāmau kuryyāt || añjaliṃ badhvā || asya 
śrīmṛtyuñjayamantrasya kahola ṛṣirddevī gāyatrīcchando mṛtyuñjayo devatā 
āyurārogyābhiṣṭhasiddhau viniyogaḥ || oṃ kahola ṛṣaye namaḥ | śirasi ||

<p. 1b> oṃ devī gāyatrīcchandase namaḥ | mukhe ||

oṃ mṛtyuñjayadevatāyai namaḥ | hṛdi || āyurārogyābhīṣṭasiddhaye namaḥ || 
karāṅganyāsaḥ || sāṁ hṛdayāya namaḥ || sīṁ śirase svāhā || sūṁ śikhāyai vaṣaṭ 
|| saiṁ kavacāya hūṃ || sauṁ netratrayāya vauṣaṭ || saḥ astrāya phaṭ || evaṃ 
hṛdayādi 8 || 

arghasthāpanaṃ || raṁ agnimaṇḍalāya namaḥ || haṁ sūryyamaṇḍalāya namaḥ || saṁ 
somamaṇḍalāya namaḥ || ṣaḍaṃgena ca saṃpūjya || tenaiva jalenātmānaṃ 
pūjopakaraṇānyubhyukṣaṇaṃ || 
āsanaṃ pūjā || oṃ ādhāraśaktaye namaḥ || oṃ anantāya namaḥ ||

<p. 2a> oṃ kandāya namaḥ || oṃ nālāyai namaḥ || oṃ padmāya namaḥ || oṃ patrebhyo 
namaḥ || oṃ keśarebhyo namaḥ || oṃ karṇikāyai namaḥ || 

tataḥ pīṭhaśaktīḥ pūjanaṃ || 
oṃ vāmāyai namaḥ || oṃ jyeṣṭhāyai namaḥ || oṃ raudryai namaḥ || oṃ kālyai namaḥ 
|| oṃ kalavikaraṇyai namaḥ || oṃ balavikaraṇyai namaḥ || oṃ balapramathinyai namaḥ ||
oṃ sarvvabhūtadamanyai namaḥ || oṃ manonmanyai namaḥ || oṃ namo bhagavate 
sakalaguṇātmaśaktiyuktāyānantāya yogapīṭhātmane namaḥ || 

tato gaṇeśaṃ pūjayet || nyāsaḥ || asyaikākṣaragaṇapatimantrasya 
gaṇaka ṛṣirnnivṛcchando

<p. 2a> gaṇapatidevatā abhīṣṭhārthasiddhaye viniyogaḥ ||

śirasi gaṇakāya ṛṣaye namaḥ || mukhe nivṛcchandase namaḥ || hṛdi śrīvighnāya 
devatāyai namaḥ || gāṁ hṛdayāya namaḥ || gīṁ śirase svāhā || gūṁ śikhāyai 
vaṣaṭ || gaiṁ kavacāya hūṃ || gauṁ netratrayāya vauṣaṭ || gaḥ astrāya phaṭ || evaṃ 
hṛdādi || ādhāraśaktaye ityādi (8) || pīṭhapūjanaṃ || oṃ tīvrāyai namaḥ || oṃ 
jvālinyai (2) || oṃ nandāyai (2) || oṃ bhogadāyai (2) || oṃ kāmarūpiṇyai (2) || oṃ ugrāyai (2) 
|| oṃ tejovatyai (2) || oṃ satyāyai (2) || madhye oṃ vighnanāśinyai namaḥ || oṃ sarvvaśakti 
kamalāsanāya namaḥ ||

<p. 3a> dhyānaṃ || 
siṃdūrābhaṃ trinetraṃ pṛthutara ḍāṭharaṃ hastapadmairddadhānaṃ 
dantaṃ pāśāṅkuśeṣṭhānyurukarevilasadvījapūrābhirāmaṃ |
bālendu dyotimauliṃ karipati vadanaṃ dāne pūrārddhagaṇḍaṃ 
bhogīndrā vaddhabhūṣaṃ bhajata gaṇapatiṃ divyavastrāṅgarāgaṃ ||

iti dhyātvā pādyādibhirupacāraiḥ saṃpūjayet || tryañjaliḥ || gaṁ gaṇapataye 
namaḥ || ṣadaṃgaḥ || āvaraṇaṃ pūjayet || oṃ vaktratuṇḍāya (2) || oṃ ekadaṃṣṭrāya 
(2) || oṃ mahodarāya (2) || oṃ gajānanāya (2) || oṃ lambodarāya (2) || oṃ vikaṭāya (2) || oṃ 
vighnarājāya namaḥ || oṃ dhūmravarṇāya (2) || dhūpa dīpa naivedyāntaṃ || japaḥ ||

<p. 3b> gaṁ (10) || stutiḥ || 

abhipretārthasiddhyarthaṃ pūjito yaḥ surottamaiḥ || 
sarvvavighnacchide tasmai gaṇādhipataye namaḥ || 

tatassūryyaṃ pūjayet || 

asya śrīsūryyamantrasya manu ṛṣirggāyatrīcchandaḥ sūryyodevatā 
adṛṣṭaphalasiddhyarthe viniyogaḥ || 

śirasi manave ṛṣaye namaḥ || mukhe gāyatrīcchandase namaḥ || hṛdi sūryyāya 
devatāyai namaḥ || 

nyāsaḥ || hrāṁ hṛdayāya namaḥ || hrīṁ śirase svāhā || hrūṁ śikhāyai vaṣaṭ || 
hraiṁ kavacāya hūṃ || hrauṁ netratrayāya vauṣaṭ || hraḥ astrāya phaṭ || 

anena hṛdādi || (6) || ādhāraśaktayetyādi 8 || pīṭhaṃ pūjayet || oṃ dīptāyai namaḥ 
|| oṃ sūkṣmāyai (2) ||

<p. 4a> oṃ jayāyai namaḥ || oṃ bhadrāyai (2) || oṃ vibhūtyai (2) || oṃ vimalāyai (2) || oṃ 
amoghāyai (2) || oṃ vidyutāyai (2) || oṃ sarvvato mukhyai (2) || madhye oṃ 
brahmaviṣṇuśivātmakāya saurapīṭhāya namaḥ || 

dhyānaṃ ||
raktāmbujāsanamaśeṣaguṇaikasindhuṃ 
bhānuṃ samastajagatāmadhipaṃ bhajāmi | 
padmadvayābhayavarāndadhataṃ karābjai
rmmāṇikyamaulimaruṇāṅgaruciṃ trinetraṃ || 

iti dhyātva pādyādibhirupacāraiḥ saṃpūjayet || tryañjaliḥ || 
hrāṁ hrīṁ saḥ suryyāya namaḥ || 3 || ṣaḍaṃgaḥ || āvaraṇaṃ pūjayet || 
sāṁ somāya namaḥ || aṁ aṅgārāya namaḥ || vuṁ budhāya namaḥ ||

<p. 4b> vṛṁ vṛhaspataye (2) || śuṁ śukrāya (2) || śaṁ śanaiścarāya (2) || rāṁ rāhave (2) || keṁ 
ketave (2) || dhūpa dīpa naivedyāntaṃ || japaḥ || hrāṁ hrīṁ saḥ (10) || 

stutiḥ || 
namaḥ savitre jagadeka cakṣuṣe jagatprasūti sthiti nāśahetave |
trayī mayāya triguṇātmadhāriṇe viriñci nārāyaṇaśaṅkarātmane ||

tato viṣṇuṃ pūjayet || 
asya dvādaśākṣaramantrasya prajāpati ṛṣirggāyatrīcchando 
viṣṇurddevatā caturvvarggaphala prāptaye viniyogaḥ ||

śirasi oṃ prajāpati ṛṣaye namaḥ || mukhe gāyatīcchandase namaḥ || hṛdi 
viṣṇudevatāyai namaḥ || nyāsaḥ ||

<p. 5a> oṃ hṛdayāya namaḥ || namaḥ śirase svāhā || bhagavate śikhāyai vaṣaṭ || 
vāsudevāyai kavacāya huṃ || oṃ namo bhagavate vāsudevāya astrāya phaṭ || 
ityanena hṛdādi pañcāṅganyāsaḥ || ādhāraśaktayetyādi || pīṭhaṃ pūjayet || oṃ 
vimalāyai namaḥ || oṃ utkarṣiṇyai (2) || oṃ jñānāyai (2) || oṃ kriyāyai (2) || oṃ yogāyai (2) || 
oṃ prahvyai (2) || oṃ satyāyai (2) || oṃ īśānāyai (2) || madhye anugrahāyai namaḥ || oṃ 
sarvvabhūtātmane vāsudevāya sarvvayogapīṭhāsanāya namaḥ || 

dhyānaṃ ||
harimujvalacakradarābjagadā
kuladoḥ parighaṃ sitapadmagataṃ ||
valayāṅgada hārakirīṭadharaṃ 
navakundarucaṃ praṇamāmi sadā ||

<p. 5b> tryañjaliḥ || namo bhagavate vāsudevāya || 3 || ṣaḍaṃgaḥ || āvaraṇaṃ 
pūjayet || oṃ vāsudevāya namaḥ || oṃ saṅkarṣaṇāya namaḥ || oṃ pradyumnāya (2) || oṃ 
aniruddhāya (2) || oṃ śāntyai (2) || oṃ sarasvatyai (2) || oṃ śriyai (2) || oṃ ratyai (2) || oṃ 
śaṃkhāya (2) || oṃ cakrāya (2) || oṃ gadāyai (2) || oṃ padmāya (2) || oṃ kostubhāya (2) || oṃ 
khaḍgāya (2) || oṃ vanamālāya (2) || oṃ garuḍāya (2) || oṃ dhvajāya (2) || oṃ aruṇāya (2) || oṃ 
durggāyai (2) || oṃ īśvarāya (2) || oṃ candrāya namaḥ || dhūpa dīpa naivedyāntaṃ || 
japamūlena (10) ||

<p. 6a> stutiḥ || 
jitente puṇḍarīkākṣa namaste viśvabhāvana |
namastestu hṛṣīkeśa mahāpuruṣapūrvvaja ||
tato durggāṃ pūjayet || asyāṣṭākṣara śrīdurggāmantrasya 
nārada ṛṣirggāyatraṃcchandaḥ śrīdurggādevatā mama 
sarvvābhīṣṭasiddhyarthe viniyogaḥ || 

śirasi nāradāya ṛṣaye namaḥ || mukhe gāyatrāyacchandase namaḥ || hṛdi 
śrīdurggāyai devatāyai namaḥ || nyāsaḥ || 
oṃ hrīṁ duṃ durggāyai hrīṁ hṛdayāya namaḥ ||
oṃ hrīṁ duṃ durggāyai hrīṁ śirase svāhā ||
oṃ hrīṁ duṃ durggāyai hrīṁ śikhāyai vaṣaṭ ||
oṃ hrīṁ duṃ durggāyai hrīṁ kavacāya hūṃ ||
oṃ hrīṁ duṃ durggāyai hrīṁ netratrayāya vauṣaṭ ||
oṃ hrīṁ duṃ durggāyai

<p. 6b> hrīṁ astrāya phaṭ || anena hṛdādi (6) || ādhāraśaktaye ityādi || pīṭhaṃ 
pūjayet || oṃ āṁ prabhāyai namaḥ || īṁ māyāyai (2) || ūṁ jayāyai (2) || eṁ sūkṣmāyai (2) 
|| aiṁ viśuddhāyai (2) || oṁ nandinyai (2) || auṁ suprabhāyai (2) || aṃ vijayāyai (2) || aḥ 
sarvvasiddhāyai namaḥ || madhye oṃ vajranakhadaṃṣṭrāyudhāya mahāsiṃhāya 
hūṃ phaṭ namaḥ || 

dhyānaṃ ||
siṃhasthā śaśiśekharā marakaṭaprakhyā caturbhirbhujaiḥ 
śaṃkhaṃ cakra dhanuḥ śarāṃśca dadhatī netraistribhiḥ śobhitā |
āmuktāṅgadahāra kaṅkaṇaraṇatkāñcī kvaṇannūpurā 
durggā durggatihāriṇī bhavatu vā ratnollasatkuṇḍalā ||

iti dhyātvā pādyādibhirupacāraiḥ pūjayet ||

<p. 7a> tryañjaliḥ || oṃ hrīṁ duṃ durggāyai namaḥ || 3 || ṣaḍaṃgaḥ || āvaraṇaṃ 
pūjayet || jaṁ jayāyai namaḥ || viṁ vijayāyai (2) || kīṁ kīrtyai (2) || prīṁ prītyai (2) || praṁ 
prabhāyai (2) || śraṁ śraddhāyai (2) || meṁ medhāyai (2) || śruṁ śrutyai (2) || śaṁ 
śaṃkhāya (2) || caṁ cakrāya (2) || gaṁ gadāyai (2) || khaṁ khaḍgāya (2) || pāṁ pāśāya (2) || 
aṁ aṅkuśāya (2) || śaṁ śarebhyo (2) || dhaṁ dhanuṣe (2) || dhūpa dīpa naivedyāntaṃ || 
japa mūlena (10) || 

stutiḥ || 
sarvvamaṅgalamaṅgalye śive sarvvārthasādhike |
śaraṇye tryambike gauri nārāyaṇi namostute ||

punaḥ prāṇāyāma ṣaḍaṃga nyāsau kṛtvā dhyāyet || 
candrārkkā gnivilocanaṃ smitamukhaṃ padmadvayāntaṃ sthitaṃ

<p. 7b> mudrāpāśa mṛgākṣasūtrapāṇiṃ himāñśuprabhaṃ |
koṭīrendumalatsudhāplutatanuṃ hārādibhūṣojvalaṃ 
kāntyā viśvavimohanaṃ paśupatiṃ mṛtyuñjayaṃ bhavaye ||

iti dhyātvā mūlena pādyādibhiḥ saṃpūjyāvaraṇaṃ pūjayet || ṣaḍaṃgena 
pūjayet || oṃ anantāya namaḥ || oṃ sūkṣmāya (2) || oṃ śivottamāya (2) || oṃ ekanetrāya 
(2) || oṃ ekarudrāya (2) || oṃ trimūrttaye (2) || oṃ śrīkaṇṭhāya (2) || oṃ śikhaṇḍine (2) || oṃ 
umāyai (2) || oṃ caṇḍeśvarāya (2) || oṃ nandine (2) || oṃ mahākālāya (2) || oṃ gaṇeśāya (2) 
|| oṃ vṛṣabhāya (2) ||

<p. 8a> oṃ bhṛṅgine (2) || oṃ skandāya (2) || oṃ indrādi lokapālebhyo namaḥ ||
oṃ vajrādyāyudhebhyo namaḥ || dhūpa dīpa naivedya tāmbūlaṃ datvā ||
oṃ juṁ saḥ mṛtyuñjayāya namaḥ || ārātrikaṃ kuryyāt || 

oṃ agyarkkendu grahādīnāṃ tejasāmapi tajasaḥ |
ārātrikamidaṃ śambho gṛhāṇa mama siddhaye ||

mūlena japaḥ (54) || stutiḥ || 
mahimnaḥ pārante paramaviduṣo yadyasadṛśī 
stutirbrahmādīnāmapi tadavasannāstvayi giraḥ |
athāvācyaḥ śarvvaḥ svamati pariṇāmāvadhi gṛṇan 
mamāpyeṣa strotre haranirapavādaḥ parikaraḥ || 

<p. 8b> ityādi stavaṃ kuryyāt || mukhavādyadaṇḍapraṇāmādikaṃ vidhāya 
sukhaṃ viharet || śubhaṃ || 

<p. 9a> oṃ namo bhagavati vāsudevāya || yudhiṣena uvāca || me masyāmaṃ pīta

<p. 9b> liṃga yoni triśūlākṣamāleṣṭābhī mṛgātmikāḥ | 
khaṭvāṃgī ca kalāpākhyā ḍamarūḥ śivato padāḥ ||




